/><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://lockedon.itch.io/nightmare-neighborhood#comments\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://lockedon.itch.io/nightmare-neighborhood/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/spooktober-2026/rate/4910095\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to Spooktober 8th Annual Visual Novel Jam</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4910095/nightmare-neighborhood\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_goudy-bookletter-1911\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Nightmare Neighborhood\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NzE5ODU4LnBuZw==/original/pHB1%2FO.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Nightmare Neighborhood</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_3164553\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://lockedon.itch.io/nightmare-neighborhood/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><em><strong>Nightmare Neighborhood</strong> is a trick-or-treating roguelike visual novel where you must manage your resources, wear different costumes to double dip houses, all&nbsp;to collect as much candy as you can without getting eaten by the monsters who inhabit the Neighborhood.</em></p>\r\n<figure><em><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMDc2ODQzLnBuZw==/original/QXWiVh.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></em><br></figure>\r\n<h3>Story</h3>\r\n<p>You are a trick-or-treater who finds herself in&nbsp;&quot;Nightmare Neighborhood&quot; &mdash; where&nbsp;every house she visits is inhabited by a real monster. The only way to get back home is to go through the final house &mdash; but without enough candy to distract it, the monster inside will eat her!</p>\r\n<h3>Gameplay</h3>\r\n<p>This game is a non-linear roguelike visual novel where you choose your own path through the Neighborhood while managing your resources.&nbsp;All the while, the clock ticks closer to midnight, and each move you make matters.</p>\r\n<p>Made in one month for the <a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/spooktober-2026\">2026 Spooktober Game Jam</a>.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMjU2MjMzLnBuZw==/original/E5Jfta.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg height=\"6\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_2829877\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"27 September 2026 @ 09:23 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 2 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" data-